ructed to have the President's speech printed for the next meeting.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0040.09","speaker_id":null,"certain":false,"name":null,"role":null},"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.synopsis-of-earlier-schemes","weight":1.0,"end":150,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":216,"start":69},{"concept":"c.synopsis-of-earlier-schemes","weight":1.0,"end":127,"label":"Synopsis","lang":"en","start":119}]},{"seg_id":"s0061.03","meeting":2,"doc":"annex","pdf":61,"printed":51,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"SYNOPSIS."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.synopsis-of-earlier-schemes","weight":1.0,"end":8,"label":"Synopsis","lang":"full","start":0}]},{"seg_id":"s0063.01","meeting":2,"doc":"annex","pdf":63,"printed":53,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"SYNOPSIS."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.synopsis-of-earlier-schemes","weight":1.0,"end":8,"label":"Synopsis","lang":"full","start":0}]}]},{"meeting":15,"section":"15","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0349.04","meeting":15,"doc":"minutes","pdf":349,"printed":339,"texts":{"fr":"Avant de quitter les Etats-Unis, Mr. Root et Mr. Brown Scott ont fait préparer un tableau synoptique comprenant les dispositions de tous ces textes, y compris le projet des Cinq Puissances, relatives à la procédure. Si le Comité n'a pas d'objection, il fera distribuer ce tableau. (Voir annexe 3).","en":"Before leaving the United States, Mr. Root and Mr. James Brown Scott had prepared a table of synopses containing the provisions of all these texts regarding procedure, including the project of the Five Powers. If the Committee had no objection he would have this table distributed. (See Annex 3).","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0349.04","speaker_id":"root","certain":true,"name":"Elihu Root","role":"member"},"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.synopsis-of-earlier-schemes","weight":1.0,"end":146,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"en","line":2587,